The Android and iOS Smart motion implementations adapt the following sources:
- sdk/android/tracelet-sdk/src/main/kotlin/com/ikolvi/tracelet/sdk/motion/MotionDetector.kt
- sdk/android/tracelet-sdk/src/main/kotlin/com/ikolvi/tracelet/sdk/motion/SpeedMotionManager.kt
- sdk/android/tracelet-sdk/src/main/kotlin/com/ikolvi/tracelet/sdk/motion/SmartMotionCoordinator.kt
- sdk/android/tracelet-sdk/src/main/kotlin/com/ikolvi/tracelet/sdk/service/LocationService.kt
- sdk/ios/Sources/TraceletSDK/motion/MotionDetector.swift
- sdk/ios/Sources/TraceletSDK/motion/SpeedMotionManager.swift
- sdk/ios/Sources/TraceletSDK/SmartMotionCoordinator.swift
- sdk/rust-core/core/src/state/smart_motion_coordinator.rs

Modified for this plugin: platform adapters call the Tencent location SDK;
the small Rust state coordinator is translated into Java and Swift.
No Rust source, runtime, FFI binding, or Tracelet binary is required.
Only continuous stationary High/Low tracking is ported. Periodic/geofence
tracking, driving classification, sync and a persistent point queue are not
part of this port. The rest of this repository retains its existing license.
